Package: worrms2
Title: Validate Taxonomic Names Against the World Register of Marine Species
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Fabio", "Weiss", email = "fabio.weiss@cawthron.org.nz",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Validate taxonomic names against the World Register of Marine
    Species using exact and fuzzy matching. Prioritise marine and accepted
    records, retrieve accepted taxonomy, flag matches for review, and join
    validation results to data frame with original taxa names. Exact searches use batch
    requests; fuzzy searches and accepted-record lookups run individually.
